    "title": "Smiths Grove residents arrested in drug bust - NewsBreak",
    "text": "WBKO\nwebsite\nSmiths Grove\nSmiths Grove residents arrested in drug bust\nBy Katy Beth Boyers,\n27 minutes agoSMITHS GROVE, Ky. (WBKO) -Two people were arrested Wednesday following a drug investigation at a Smiths Grove home where a teenager was present. The Warren County Sheriff’s Office responded with the Department for Community Based Services to a complaint of drug use at a home on Will Bohannon Road on Oct. 15.",
